Engineering takeaway
A dependable fitness subscription system does not ask “Did the client say payment succeeded?” It asks “What does the verified store state entitle this authenticated account to access right now?” Make that decision centrally, process notifications idempotently, recover through reconciliation, and keep user account ownership explicit.
